## 11. Performance budget (must pass before deploy)

- Lighthouse (mobile, simulated Moto G Power / slow 4G): **Performance ≥ 95, Accessibility 100, Best Practices 100, SEO 100** on `/`, `/research`, `/projects`, in both `en` and one RTL locale.
- Core Web Vitals targets: LCP < 2.0 s, CLS < 0.05, INP < 200 ms.
- First-load JS on `/` ≤ 120 KB gzipped **excluding** the lazily loaded 3D chunk. Report sizes with `@next/bundle-analyzer`.
- Images: `next/image`, AVIF/WebP, explicit sizes, only the hero text is LCP (photo is not `priority`).
- No layout shift from fonts (`size-adjust`/`adjustFontFallback`), from images (fixed aspect ratios) or from the 3D canvas (container reserves its size; poster shown first).
- No third-party scripts besides Vercel Analytics/Speed Insights. No external font CDNs.
- Test on a throttled low-end profile (4× CPU slowdown) and confirm scrolling stays smooth and the 3D falls back to the poster when it should.

